The entry's Previous/Next links still have a Budapest date offset: on September 25, Previous points to September 23 and Next points back to September 25. The calendar's direct route worked; adjacent-day navigation is not demonstrated here. The current-flow media is from a local fictional fixture, not a hosted multi-user app. Licensed Cartesia narration, paired Remotion release films, timed captions, a final exceptional poster, and the date-navigation fix remain open.
